1
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:11,886
Your legs are still
holding a lot of tension.

2
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:15,807
You tend to tense up
when you walk, right?

3
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:24,566
In cases like that
this area here...

4
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:25,525
Wait!

5
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:26,693
What are you doing?

6
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:30,780
You have to loosen up.
That'll make treatment easier.

7
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,907
No, it's... it tickles!

8
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,534
Hold still.

9
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:36,077
No, seriously! Stop!

10
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:38,079
I said stop!

11
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:42,960
Sorry.

12
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:49,883
No, it's fine.

13
00:00:49,883 --> 00:00:52,886
I was being too sensitive.

14
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:58,808
What matters most is
being comfortable.

15
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,935
The real core of therapy

16
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:03,563
is helping your mind relax.

17
00:01:03,563 --> 00:01:06,983
I might seem like I'm joking
but the more we connect

18
00:01:07,567 --> 00:01:10,570
recovery tends to speed up.

19
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:13,239
So... teasing's okay?

20
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:15,116
Nope.

21
00:01:15,742 --> 00:01:18,745
Enough for today.

22
00:01:19,579 --> 00:01:23,583
Of course, Seung-hyun.
Your comfort comes first.

23
00:01:26,419 --> 00:01:29,422
I'll come back tomorrow.

24
00:01:30,048 --> 00:01:33,051
Have a good night.
